nvfp4moe third-party notices
============================

nvfp4moe contains modified and adapted NVIDIA Apache-2.0 and BSD-3-Clause software.
These notices and license terms must remain with source and binary redistributions.

NVIDIA grouped weight-gradient kernel
--------------------------------------

nvfp4moe/kernels/wgrad contains an adapted grouped block-scaled GEMM
weight-gradient implementation originating from NVIDIA cuDNN Frontend
examples. The files retain NVIDIA copyright and SPDX Apache-2.0 headers.

Upstream: https://github.com/NVIDIA/cudnn-frontend

NVIDIA grouped forward GEMM
---------------------------

nvfp4moe/kernels/grouped_gemm.py derives from NVIDIA CUTLASS's Blackwell
grouped block-scaled CuTe DSL example. The file retains NVIDIA's BSD-3-Clause
copyright notice and license text.

Upstream: https://github.com/NVIDIA/cutlass

